# Copy to .op/refs.env (gitignored) or export OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID in your shell.
# 1Password → Developer → Environments:
#
#   amigo (dev)  — local `bun run dev`, Cursor Cloud Agents, manual deploy
#   amigo (prod) — Cloudflare Workers Builds (OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID build secret)
#
# Cursor Cloud Agents: do not copy .op/refs.env or individual app secrets into
# Cursor. Set only OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN + OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID — see README
# § Cursor Cloud Agents.
#
# Use the Environment UUID from 1Password, not the display name.
OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID=
